# Beats — the Algorithm's dark patterns
#
# Every one of these is a polite little trap. The "easy" option always
# raises heat and routes through `lockdown`; the careful option costs you
# a beat of friction and keeps you clean.

# The cookie banner — the friendliest trap on the floor.
== cookie_consent(guest)
  cast: Cookie_Banner, guest
  COOKIE_BANNER
    This site uses cookies. And eyes. And ears.
    Do you accept all cookies?
  * Accept all (it's easier)
    <set: guest.heat += 25>
    <respond: Tracking enabled. Thank you for your obedience.>
    -> lockdown
  * Reject non-essential
    <set: guest.karma += 10>
  + Pretend to read the 90-page policy
    <set: guest.karma += 1>

# An unskippable ad.
== the_ad(guest)
  cast: Ad_Popup, guest
  AD_POPUP
    You won't BELIEVE the one weird trick the Mods are hiding!
    Skip in 5, 4, 3...
  * Click the ad
    The download starts before your thumb can stop it.
    <set: guest.heat += 30>
    -> lockdown
  * Wait for the skip button
    <set: guest.karma += 5>
  * Actually buy the thing
    <set: guest.score -= 20>
    <set: guest.verified = true>

# free_movie_HD_no_virus_trust_me.exe
== download(guest)
  cast: Download_Station, guest
  DOWNLOAD_STATION
    free_movie_HD_totally_no_virus_trust_me.exe is ready to run.
  * Run it
    <set: guest.heat += 35>
    <respond: Trojan installed. The Algorithm thanks you for your trust.>
    -> lockdown
  * Scan it first, like a responsible packet
    <set: guest.karma += 5>
  + Walk away
    <set: guest.karma += 1>

# A paywall across reality itself.
== paywall(guest)
  cast: Paywall, guest
  PAYWALL
    To read the rest of reality, please subscribe.
  * Pay up
    <set: guest.score -= 15>
    <set: guest.verified = true>
  * Pirate it
    <set: guest.heat += 25>
    -> lockdown
  + Hit the back button
    <set: guest.karma += 1>
